{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And the earth was corrupted before Ha-Elohim.</b> Before the great ones who were in the land — for they would take the women by force." "<b>And the earth was filled with violence.</b> What is חמס and what is גזל (robbery)? חמס is something worth a perutah; גזל is less than a perutah's worth. And so the men of the generation of the flood would do: one of them would take out a basket full of lupines to the market, this one comes and takes less than a perutah's worth, and this one less than a perutah's worth, until he cannot recover from them in court. HaShem said to them: you acted improperly, so I too will act with you improperly and out of order — as it is written: ״הלא נסע יתרם בם ימותו ולא בחכמה״ — without the wisdom of the Torah. <b>Violence.</b> Forbidden sexual relations, as it is written: ״חמסי ושארי״. <b>Violence.</b> Idolatry, as it is written: ״חמס וישובו להכעיסני״. <b>Violence.</b> Bloodshed, as it is written: ״מחמס בני יהודה אשר שפכו דם נקי בארצם״."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {1 "The text uses geiresh-style abbreviation marks (׳) after several words; resolved as punctuation separating interpretations. The phrase לפני האלהים in comment 0 rendered 'before Ha-Elohim' per divine-name rules; note the definiteness differs from bare אלהים."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:13.807566011Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}